        "name": "Landing Page",
        "description": "The landing page greets users with the FreshFruit Store logo and a vibrant banner image. Users see featured fruits with images, prices, and short descriptions. There is a section highlighting promotions or best-sellers, alongside customer testimonials. The page displays store contact info (address, phone number, email) and business hours. Users can enter their email to subscribe to a newsletter and can click to browse the full product catalog or contact the store."
